{
  "name": "Transcribe video and audio to SRT subtitles with Inwista",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "name": "Note overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -460,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 360,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Transcribe any recording with Inwista\n\nPaste a media URL, run the workflow, get a finished **SRT subtitle file** back.\n\n1. Set your file URL in **Set media URL**\n2. The Inwista API transcribes it (speaker labels included)\n3. The loop polls until the job is done\n4. **Get SRT** returns the subtitle file\n\nSwap the manual trigger for a Google Drive / Dropbox trigger to make it fully automatic."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-setup",
      "name": "Note setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 360,
        "height": 280,
        "content": "## Setup (2 minutes)\n\n1. Create a free API key at [inwista.ai](https://inwista.ai/dashboard/workspace) under *My workspace → API keys*\n2. Create a **Header Auth** credential:\n   - Name: `Authorization`\n   - Value: `Bearer inw_live_...`\n3. Attach it to both HTTP nodes\n\n**Cost:** 4 credits per started minute, charged on acceptance. Failed jobs refund automatically. The free tier covers testing."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-extend",
      "name": "Note extend",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1180,
        -400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 360,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "## Extend it\n\n- `?format=vtt` / `txt` / `json` on the captions URL\n- `POST /translate` for multilingual subtitles\n- `POST /enhance` for broadcast-style formatting\n- `retention: \"none\"` for sensitive recordings\n\nFull walkthrough: [inwista.ai/en/article/build-a-fully-automated-transcription-pipeline-with-n8n](https://inwista.ai/en/article/build-a-fully-automated-transcription-pipeline-with-n8n)"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "When clicking Test workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "position": [
        -260,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "seturl",
      "name": "Set media URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        -60,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "mediaUrl",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://your-file-host.com/recording.mp4"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "language",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "en"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "submit",
      "name": "Submit transcription",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        140,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.inwista.ai/v1/transcriptions",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"source_url\": \"{{ $json.mediaUrl }}\",\n  \"language\": \"{{ $json.language }}\",\n  \"diarization\": true,\n  \"metadata\": { \"source\": \"n8n-template\" }\n}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{ $execution.id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "wait",
      "name": "Wait 15s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "position": [
        340,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 15
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "status",
      "name": "Check status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        540,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.inwista.ai/v1/transcriptions/{{ $('Submit transcription').item.json.id }}",
        "options": {},
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "isdone",
      "name": "Is it done?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        740,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "caseSensitive": true
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "completed"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "isfailed",
      "name": "Has it failed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        940,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "caseSensitive": true
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "failed"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "stoperror",
      "name": "Stop on failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "position": [
        1140,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "=Inwista transcription failed: {{ $json.error?.code || 'unknown_error' }}. The job is refunded automatically — check the source URL is publicly reachable and retry."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "srt",
      "name": "Get SRT",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.inwista.ai/v1/transcriptions/{{ $('Submit transcription').item.json.id }}/captions?format=srt",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "connections": {
    "Wait 15s": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check status",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Is it done?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get SRT",
